# Docs links

- Repository-internal links must be relative (e.g. `[api.md](../backend/api.md)`).
- Forbidden: `/docs/...` root-absolute, `file://`, broken targets.
- Prefer display text = basename + optional section cue.
- After renames: update all references; run:

```bash
node scripts/docs/validate_relative_links.cjs docs contracts paths README.md
```

Full rules: `docs/guides/relative-link-usage-rules.md`.
